The overall deflection rate continue dropping over the last several weeks - [Looker report|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/customer_support/self_help_funnel_new?qid=4wGeLX1k06ZjuO6rDSY9kD&origin_space=1604&toggle=fil]. The request deflection rate is more accurate to look at - [Looker report|https://bolt.cloud.looker.com/explore/customer_support/self_help_funnel_new?qid=PnNitzfUhiRZYpPX7NG3fC&origin_space=1604&toggle=fil]. No big improvement can be observed.

